## SCHEMA EVOLUTION NOTES

The system maintains backward compatibility:
- Captions loaded from API may not have `styleOverrides` initially
- When word overrides are applied, `styleOverrides` is added to the word object
- Rendering safely handles missing `styleOverrides` \(treats as undefined\)
- No database schema changes needed for this feature

